  "details": "One day I started playing vrchat and suddenly the game crashed after 10 minutes, something normal, that happens sometimes, however, when I continued entering the game it started to crash after those 10 minutes of play approximately, the only change I remember having made was to enable the 6 point body tracking; however, even disabling it did not work, I deleted the vrchat folder in LocalLow nothing, run the game on Steam instead of Quest Link and nothing, I completely deleted and reinstalled vrchat nothing, I formatted the computer and reinstalled the game as usual and ... nothing! It kept crashing, it just does not make sense, I attached some logs in case they are helpful.",
